  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tayamba Soya Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will focus on capacity building; financial training; and farmer training to improve the management capacities of Tayambawhile empowering its members with improved skills in soya farming and providing them with access to improved soya bean seeds and other inputs through a revolving loan fund.</narrative>
  </description>
